#: src/widget/preferences.rs:235
msgid "Change how the header bar is presented for active connection screens."
msgstr "Endre korleis topplinja vert vist for aktive tilkoplingsskjermar."

#: src/widget/preferences.rs:237
msgid ""
"The header bar is shown above the connection screen. In fullscreen mode, the "
"header bar is instead overlaid and hides whenever input is grabbed."
msgstr ""
"Topplinja vert vist over tilkoplingsskjermen. I fullskjermmodus ligg "
"topplinja i staden som eit overlegg og vert gøymd kvar gong inndata vert "
"fanga."

#: src/widget/preferences.rs:238
